# Phase C — declarative apt source for VSCodium.
#
# VSCodium is the FLOSS rebuild of Microsoft VSCode — same Electron app
# with the proprietary Microsoft branding, telemetry, and EULA-tied
# marketplace stripped out.  Extensions come from Open VSX Registry
# (open-vsx.org) by default; the Microsoft-marketplace-only extensions
# (e.g. ms-python.python, ms-vscode-remote.*) do NOT work here by design.
#
# Signing-key fingerprint pinned in config/apps/apps.toml.  Source of
# truth (rotation cadence multi-year):
#   https://vscodium.com/#install
#   https://gitlab.com/paulcarroty/vscodium-deb-rpm-repo

Types: deb
URIs: https://paulcarroty.gitlab.io/vscodium-deb-rpm-repo/debs
Suites: vscodium
Components: main
Architectures: amd64 arm64
Signed-By: /etc/apt/keyrings/vscodium-keyring.gpg
